INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (31, 'And we can add a list of `dependencies` that will be added to all the *path operations* in the router and will be executed/solved for each request made to them.

/// tip

Note that, much like [dependencies in *path operation decorators*](dependencies/dependencies-in-path-operation-decorators.md), no value will be passed to your *path operation function*.

///

The end result is that the item paths are now:

* `/items/`
