INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (66, 'This could be useful, for example, to expose the same API under different prefixes, e.g. `/api/v1` and `/api/latest`.

This is an advanced usage that you might not really need, but it''s there in case you do.

## Include an `APIRouter` in another { #include-an-apirouter-in-another }

