INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (73, 'Remember that when you import `Query`, `Path`, and others from `fastapi`, those are actually functions that return special classes.

///

/// tip

Notice how each model''s attribute with a type, default value and `Field` has the same structure as a *path operation function''s* parameter, with `Field` instead of `Path`, `Query` and `Body`.

///

