INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (92, '## List fields with type parameter { #list-fields-with-type-parameter }

But Python has a specific way to declare lists with internal types, or "type parameters":

### Declare a `list` with a type parameter { #declare-a-list-with-a-type-parameter }

To declare types that have type parameters (internal types), like `list`, `dict`, `tuple`,
