INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (122, 'Your API almost always has to send a **response** body. But clients don''t necessarily need to send **request bodies** all the time, sometimes they only request a path, maybe with some query parameters, but don''t send a body.

To declare a **request** body, you use [Pydantic](https://docs.pydantic.dev/) models with all their power and benefits.

/// note

