INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (133, 'And it was thoroughly tested at the design phase, before any implementation, to ensure it would work with all the editors.

There were even some changes to Pydantic itself to support this.

The previous screenshots were taken with [Visual Studio Code](https://code.visualstudio.com).

