INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (172, 'The main purpose of the `__name__ == "__main__"` is to have some code that is executed when your file is called with:

<div class="termy">

```console
$ python myapp.py
```

</div>

but is not called when another file imports it, like in:

```Python
from myapp import app
```

#### More details { #more-details }

Let''s say your file is named `myapp.py`.

If you run it with:

<div class="termy">

```console
$ python myapp.py
```

