INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (225, 'The OpenAPI schema is what powers the two interactive documentation systems included.

And there are dozens of alternatives, all based on OpenAPI. You could easily add any of those alternatives to your application built with **FastAPI**.

