INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (226, '### Configure the app `entrypoint` in `pyproject.toml` { #configure-the-app-entrypoint-in-pyproject-toml }

You can configure where your app is located in a `pyproject.toml` file like:

```toml
[tool.fastapi]
entrypoint = "main:app"
```

That `entrypoint` will tell the `fastapi` command that it should import the app like:

```python
from main import app
```

