INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (227, 'If your code was structured like:

```
.
├── backend
│   ├── main.py
│   ├── __init__.py
```

Then you would set the `entrypoint` as:

```toml
[tool.fastapi]
entrypoint = "backend.main:app"
```

which would be equivalent to:

```python
from backend.main import app
```

