INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (228, 'You can also pass the file path to the `fastapi dev` command, and it will guess the FastAPI app object to use:

```console
$ fastapi dev main.py
```

Or, you can also pass the `--entrypoint` option to the `fastapi dev` command:

```console
$ fastapi dev --entrypoint main:app
```

