INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (236, 'The `@app.get("/")` tells **FastAPI** that the function right below is in charge of handling requests that go to:

* the path `/`
* using a <dfn title="an HTTP GET method"><code>get</code> operation</dfn>

/// note | `@decorator` Info

That `@something` syntax in Python is called a "decorator".

