INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (247, 'Your project structure could look like this:

```text
.
├── pyproject.toml
├── app
│   ├── __init__.py
│   └── main.py
└── dist
    ├── index.html
    └── assets
        └── app.js
```

Then serve it with `app.frontend()`:

{* ../../docs_src/frontend/tutorial001_py310.py hl[5] *}

With this, a request for `/assets/app.js` can serve `dist/assets/app.js`.

