INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (257, 'With `check_dir=False`, **FastAPI** will not check the directory when the app is created. If the configured directory is still missing when a request is handled, **FastAPI** will raise an error then.

## Use it with `APIRouter` { #use-it-with-apirouter }

You can also add frontend files to an `APIRouter` and include it with a prefix:

