INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (272, 'These handlers are in charge of returning the default JSON responses when you `raise` an `HTTPException` and when the request has invalid data.

You can override these exception handlers with your own.

### Override request validation exceptions { #override-request-validation-exceptions }

When a request contains invalid data, **FastAPI** internally raises a `RequestValidationError`.

