INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (273, 'To override it, import the `RequestValidationError` and use it with `@app.exception_handler(RequestValidationError)` to decorate the exception handler.

The exception handler will receive a `Request` and the exception.

{* ../../docs_src/handling_errors/tutorial004_py310.py hl[2,14:19] *}

