INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (289, 'For example, if you have a header parameter `save_data` in the code, the expected HTTP header will be `save-data`, and it will show up like that in the docs.

If for some reason you need to disable this automatic conversion, you can do it as well for Pydantic models for header parameters.

