INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (310, 'The first step is to install FastAPI.

Make sure you create a [virtual environment](../virtual-environments.md), activate it, and then **install FastAPI**:

<div class="termy">

```console
$ pip install "fastapi[standard]"

---> 100%
```

</div>

