INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (406, 'We are going to enforce that even though `q` is optional, whenever it is provided, **its length doesn''t exceed 50 characters**.

### Import `Query` and `Annotated` { #import-query-and-annotated }

To achieve that, first import:

* `Query` from `fastapi`
* `Annotated` from `typing`

{* ../../docs_src/query_params_str_validations/tutorial002_an_py310.py hl[1,3] *}

