INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (413, 'Previous versions of FastAPI (before <dfn title="before 2023-03">0.95.0</dfn>) required you to use `Query` as the default value of your parameter, instead of putting it in `Annotated`, there''s a high chance that you will see code using it around, so I''ll explain it to you.

/// tip

For new code and whenever possible, use `Annotated` as explained above. There are multiple advantages (explained below) and no disadvantages. 🍰

