INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (422, 'Because `Annotated` can have more than one metadata annotation, you could now even use the same function with other tools, like [Typer](https://typer.tiangolo.com/). 🚀

## Add more validations { #add-more-validations }

You can also add a parameter `min_length`:

{* ../../docs_src/query_params_str_validations/tutorial003_an_py310.py hl[10] *}

