INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (429, 'When you define a query parameter explicitly with `Query` you can also declare it to receive a list of values, or said in another way, to receive multiple values.

For example, to declare a query parameter `q` that can appear multiple times in the URL, you can write:

{* ../../docs_src/query_params_str_validations/tutorial011_an_py310.py hl[9] *}

Then, with a URL like:

```
http://localhost:8000/items/?q=foo&q=bar
