INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (433, 'For example, `list[int]` would check (and document) that the contents of the list are integers. But `list` alone wouldn''t.

///

## Declare more metadata { #declare-more-metadata }

You can add more information about the parameter.

That information will be included in the generated OpenAPI and used by the documentation user interfaces and external tools.

