INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (437, 'You have to leave it there a while because there are clients using it, but you want the docs to clearly show it as <dfn title="obsolete, recommended not to use it">deprecated</dfn>.

Then pass the parameter `deprecated=True` to `Query`:

{* ../../docs_src/query_params_str_validations/tutorial010_an_py310.py hl[19] *}

The docs will show it like this:

