INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (445, 'Then with `random.choice()` we can get a **random value** from the list, so, we get a tuple with `(id, name)`. It will be something like `("imdb-tt0371724", "The Hitchhiker''s Guide to the Galaxy")`.

Then we **assign those two values** of the tuple to the variables `id` and `name`.

So, if the user didn''t provide an item ID, they will still receive a random suggestion.

