INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (517, 'With this, we get tooling support, from editors and mypy as this code is correct in terms of types, but we also get the data filtering from FastAPI.

How does this work? Let''s check that out. 🤓

### Type Annotations and Tooling { #type-annotations-and-tooling }

