INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (519, 'The editor, mypy, and other tools won''t complain about this because, in typing terms, `UserIn` is a subclass of `BaseUser`, which means it''s a *valid* type when what is expected is anything that is a `BaseUser`.

### FastAPI Data Filtering { #fastapi-data-filtering }

