INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (527, '...this fails because the type annotation is not a Pydantic type and is not just a single `Response` class or subclass, it''s a union (any of the two) between a `Response` and a `dict`.

### Disable Response Model { #disable-response-model }

