INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (552, '# Declare Request Example Data { #declare-request-example-data }

You can declare examples of the data your app can receive.

Here are several ways to do it.

## Extra JSON Schema data in Pydantic models { #extra-json-schema-data-in-pydantic-models }

You can declare `examples` for a Pydantic model that will be added to the generated JSON Schema.

