INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (553, 'That extra info will be added as-is to the output **JSON Schema** for that model, and it will be used in the API docs.

You can use the attribute `model_config` that takes a `dict` as described in [Pydantic''s docs: Configuration](https://docs.pydantic.dev/latest/api/config/).

You can set `"json_schema_extra"` with a `dict` containing any additional data you would like to show up in the generated JSON Schema, including `examples`.

