INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (555, 'Before that, it only supported the keyword `example` with a single example. That is still supported by OpenAPI 3.1.0, but is deprecated and is not part of the JSON Schema standard. So you are encouraged to migrate `example` to `examples`. 🤓

You can read more at the end of this page.

///

## `Field` additional arguments { #field-additional-arguments }

