INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (561, 'The shape of this OpenAPI-specific field `examples` is a `dict` with **multiple examples** (instead of a `list`), each with extra information that will be added to **OpenAPI** too.

This doesn''t go inside of each JSON Schema contained in OpenAPI, this goes outside, in the *path operation* directly.

