INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (586, 'When a browser reconnects after a connection drop, it sends the last received `id` in the `Last-Event-ID` header.

You can read it as a header parameter and use it to resume the stream from where the client left off:

{* ../../docs_src/server_sent_events/tutorial004_py310.py hl[25,27,31] *}

## SSE with POST { #sse-with-post }

