INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (648, 'If each JSON item you want to send back is of type `Item` (a Pydantic model) and it''s an async function, you can declare the return type as `AsyncIterable[Item]`:

{* ../../docs_src/stream_json_lines/tutorial001_py310.py ln[1:24] hl[9:11,22] *}

If you declare the return type, FastAPI will use it to **validate** the data, **document** it in OpenAPI, **filter** it, and **serialize** it using Pydantic.

