INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (657, 'And your **FastAPI** application might also be composed of several files/modules, etc.

### **FastAPI** app file { #fastapi-app-file }

Let''s say you have a file structure as described in [Bigger Applications](bigger-applications.md):

```
.
├── app
│   ├── __init__.py
│   └── main.py
```

In the file `main.py` you have your **FastAPI** app:


{* ../../docs_src/app_testing/app_a_py310/main.py *}

