INSERT INTO public.chunks (id, content, source, page, embedding) VALUES (664, 'If you have a Pydantic model in your test and you want to send its data to the application during testing, you can use the `jsonable_encoder` described in [JSON Compatible Encoder](encoder.md).

///

## Run it { #run-it }

After that, you just need to install `pytest`.

Make sure you create a [virtual environment](../virtual-environments.md), activate it, and then install it, for example:

<div class="termy">

```console
